aragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5ec008b4f142b261738a5566f8569f0d.avif?t=1775744847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/5ec008b4f142b261738a5566f8569f0d.webp?t=1775744847 width=1560 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/9717397bd9884f8c5590ce8471a43f03.avif?t=1775744847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/9717397bd9884f8c5590ce8471a43f03.webp?t=1775744847 width=1560 height=349 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your magic abilities are dazzlingly diverse; summon storms of fireballs, manipulate time,  transform objects into frogs, master natural magic particles. Discover mystical artifacts and spellbinding objects each reacting uniquely to your interactions such as ancient relics that whisper, potions that turn you into a giant to name a few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/3891280f84079c33ab75f21f8ece505e.avif?t=1775744847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/3891280f84079c33ab75f21f8ece505e.webp?t=1775744847 width=1560 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/278ab261693b303186df217296c90340.avif?t=1775744847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/278ab261693b303186df217296c90340.webp?t=1775744847 width=1560 height=349 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use voice interactions with blazingly fast responsiveness to talk to characters or use voice commands to magically modify anything to your heart's desire - where you just need to be careful not to break the reality if you go to far! For those who prefer to remain silent there is always the optional Type to Talk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/448b332f7faeb7c2140b5e4aa5514785.avif?t=1775744847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/448b332f7faeb7c2140b5e4aa5514785.webp?t=1775744847 width=1560 height=89 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/8d07c49096b7829cedf98bf750f89822.avif?t=1775744847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/8d07c49096b7829cedf98bf750f89822.webp?t=1775744847 width=1560 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fantasy world filled with bizarre curiosities, hilarious secrets and many hours of gameplay. Whether you\u2019re navigating Skully\u2019s past memories, hunting for glory in the Observer Fortress, or strapping Skully to an unstable medieval rocket, get ready for a journey defined by pure, whimsical weirdness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/0527d3664f0054996cacebf93590cc98.avif?t=1775744847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/0527d3664f0054996cacebf93590cc98.webp?t=1775744847 width=1560 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/94a882052057e403f7a129d454574f87.avif?t=1775744847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/94a882052057e403f7a129d454574f87.webp?t=1775744847 width=1560 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waltz of the Wizard has greatly expanded with multiple  updates since the original release!\u00a0Each update has introduced something totally new, often experiemental and always new content, more to do with Skully and many new secrets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/daf37d576626a5adcad9d27a216e20c2.avif?t=1775744847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/daf37d576626a5adcad9d27a216e20c2.webp?t=1775744847 width=1560 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6  Top 50 Best Selling Quest Games of All Time - <i>Meta</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\ufe0f Featured in &quot;New Games We Love&quot; - <i>Apple Editors</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Winner of Best Updated Game - <i>UploadVR</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\ufe0f \u201cExceptionally well-received\u201d - <i>Rolling Stone Magazine</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Winner of Best Innovation - <i>NYX Game Awards</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\ufe0f \u201cAldin helped pioneer VR as we know it today\u201d - <i>Road to VR</i></p>","developers":["Aldin Dynamics"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/a609a9d